### ==========================================
### API V1 VERSIONED ROUTE TESTS
### ==========================================

### 1. Test Versioned Route Without Token (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json


### 2. Test Versioned Route With Valid Token (Should return 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 3. Test Creating a Ticket on Versioned Route (Should return 201 Created for USER)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot access server",
  "description": "Getting timeout errors while attempting connection",
  "status": "OPEN"
}


### 4. Test Legacy Route Compatibility (Should still work with a token)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### ==========================================
### TICKET REPORT AGGREGATION TESTS
### ==========================================

### 1. Fetch Ticket Counts Grouped By Status (Requires valid Token)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Fetch Ticket Counts Grouped by Priority
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-priority
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json